    "rating": 4.8,
    "reference": "ChIJlyJfdEdIyUwRuIy7oU5StBk",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "John Cristinziani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112927590079985365391/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgp4F2YTlknIIqfIwudWNM1UOukVGfhFd0OsrGvpA8NPqWdg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "The team installed my cabanon 26 years ago and it still looks amazing. I had my shed door replaced as the bottom was worn out from sitting in the snow for all these years. The work was once again done promptly and efficiently as always.  I highly recommend this company, try them, you will not be disappointed and their product last a long time without any hassles!",
        "time": 1757459208,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dev Rishi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114457152679305431343/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITaQGKeO2f8OGzXRSUCgbqNECmVQ4QXXBx5Yk-WhgwwYcrNG0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Thanks Pier for rectifying the mistake and get it done before the deadline. Best job done by you and your guys.",
        "time": 1758556754,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "santori1970",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101516348222919407551/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKUN_eCE-o2RSGs4hlPDI0wP9cqoVsUwPPQel97q8XPC14TLg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "From start to finish the service we received from Cabanons Fontaine was excellent.  We met with Pier-Luc Sevigny and his knowledge, professionalism and overall assistance was very impressive.\n\nWe were able to put together the project with great ease and the help we received to obtain the permit for the build was also above and beyond.   Pier-Luc also recommended Latreille Excavation to install the 9x12 cement pad for this project and we were extremely happy with their service and expertise as well.  The price for both services was very reasonable and within our budget.\n\nOn the day of the installation Pier-Luc's team showed up bright and early and worked tirelessly through the day to complete the Cabanon Garage.  The materials used are sturdy and precise and the workers were polite and extremely effiecient.\n\nThank you to Pier-Luc for such an amazing experience, we were very satisfied with this company and we highly recommend them for your next project.",
        "time": 1590939642,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Matthew Venditti",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110302770023264863335/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIbTsEp2yBlEn2KrAmAORhhTFprd-D5if-e5KNq_CJ1xesW7Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I went into Cabanon Fontaine and delt with Pierre-Luc from vaudreuil. I knew exactly what I wanted and he helped me big time with  narrowing down all the decisions. I was in and out in 30 minutes with the exact shed I needed.\nMatt",
        "time": 1726273438,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ian Seivwright",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107359055982412797463/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKFAFgKbx15adpRxDUBZf0gMPK1omMY8XtQLUDZ6G3gLpVoAA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Shed purchased summer 2021, installed in Oct. 2021 by CF.\nPad preparation cost of $700 turned out to be an extra and had to be paid cash to contractor before he even started the work for which he showed up at 7:00pm on a Friday night in mid October.\nI understood this was included in cost but it wasn't, as a result a 10' x 10'  shed ended up costing $9,627.81.\nContract is deceiving with 56 line items of options but only a single price on the Total line.\nWinter 2022 top 3 rows of shingles were blow off and over winter shed became un-level slanting towards rear.\nTech came early spring 2022. repaired roof, and re-leveled but over compensated so now the shed is more off level than before but in opposite direction.\nSpring 2022 another shingle blown off.\nSent 2 emails to head office and made 3 visits to Mathieu in Vaudreuil to have service come repair shingle again and re-level shed. Still no response.",
        "time": 1669524031,
        "translated": false
      }
